WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.750
Have you seen this

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.711
footage of all of these rockets

00:00:02.711 --> 00:00:04.796
raining down on to Israel?

00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:06.715
They're calling this Israel's 9/11

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:08.925
because it totally caught them off guard.

00:00:08.925 --> 00:00:10.927
And it's one of the most ambitious attacks

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:12.178
in a really long time.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:13.304
The rockets were fired

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:14.931
by a group called Hamas,

00:00:14.931 --> 00:00:16.641
which refuses Israel's

00:00:16.641 --> 00:00:18.059
right to even exist.

00:00:18.059 --> 00:00:18.685
For decades,

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.645
Hamas has protested Israel's

00:00:20.645 --> 00:00:22.689
occupation of Palestinian territory

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:23.898
by launching missiles

00:00:23.898 --> 00:00:24.941
from this small slice

00:00:24.941 --> 00:00:26.151
of Palestine down here

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:27.193
called the Gaza Strip.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:27.777
But this attack

00:00:27.777 --> 00:00:28.945
was more deadly than normal.

00:00:28.945 --> 00:00:29.946
It's killed at least

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:31.698
700 Israelis, most of them

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:33.700
civilians and thousands more wounded.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.743
Israel immediately

00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:36.161
declared war against Hamas

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:36.703
and the Israeli

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:38.496
air force began dropping bombs, killing

00:00:38.496 --> 00:00:40.498
hundreds of Palestinian civilians.

00:00:40.498 --> 00:00:41.124
They’re activating

00:00:41.124 --> 00:00:43.043
300,000 of their reservists

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.085
to get ready to fight.

00:00:44.085 --> 00:00:44.753
They're promising

00:00:44.753 --> 00:00:46.087
that this is just the beginning.

00:00:46.087 --> 00:00:47.380
I'll be following this conflict

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:48.465
as it unfolds and helping

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:49.340
you understand it in case

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:50.050
you want to follow for more.

